{"id":717,"root":"كظم","bw":"kZm","tr":"k-ẓ-m","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\">See Supplement </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَظَمَ غَيظَهُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>He repressed,</em> or <em>restrained, his wrath,</em> or <em>rage.</em> (K.) ― -b2- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَظَمَ</span>, aor. <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَظِمَ</span> </span>, inf. n. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَظْمٌ</span>, <em>He restrained himself.</em> (TA.) ― -b3- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَا يَكْظِمُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَى جِرَّةٍ</span>; and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَا يَكْظِمٌ عَلَى جِرَّتِهِ</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِرَّةٌ</span>. ― -b4- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَظَمَ عَلَى غَيظِهِ</span> <em>i. q.</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَظَمَ غَيظَهُ</span>. (TA.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَظَايءِمُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> [pl. of <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كِظَامَةٌ</span>] <em>Subterranean conduits for water.</em> (TA in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قنو</span>.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":820,"entries":3,"shownEntries":3,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"kZm"}